# Vercel detects "Node" purely because server.js sits at the repo root, and then
# uses it as the serverless entrypoint. server.js calls http.createServer().listen()
# and exports no handler, so every request 404s. This is a static site — excluding
# the local preview server makes Vercel fall through to static file serving.
server.js

# Internal notes, not part of the published site.
AGENTS.md

# CV source template (the generated PDF at assets/Priyanshu-Rana-CV.pdf is what ships).
assets/cv/
